   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Empty (Live at Field of Vision '25)**: back after 207 archived shows (3960 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Swan Song (Live at Field of Vision '25)**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Welcome to an Altered Future (Live at Field of Vision '25)**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- **Rattlesnake (Live at Field of Vision '25)**: with King Stingray [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-08-16.SBD.wav** (recommended): soundboard; 26 songs; 175 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-08-16.mk21-discocape**: source not stated; 26 songs; 182 min [2]\n- **kglw2025-08-16.dpa4006-decca.flac24**: source not stated; 26 songs; 177 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: King Stingray [1]\n- Performance dedicated to Matt Gawiak, who died the day before the concert [1]\n- Fan Callum played Stu’s guitar during this specific song [1]\n- Dimathaya Burarrwanga and Yimila Gurruwiwi played yiḏaki during the final song [1]\n- First performance since 2014, featuring flute for the first time [2]\n- Played at the request of Wayne Gordon, a Daptone recording artist [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-08-16.SBD.wav**: source: SBD [1]\n- **kglw2025-08-16.mk21-discocape**: taped by discocape; transferred by discocape; source: Schoeps cmc1k/mk21's [2]. Also: Discocape recorded using Schoeps cmc1k/mk21 microphones in ORTF configuration into a mixpre 6ii [2]\n- **kglw2025-08-16.dpa4006-decca.flac24**: taped by Scott Schneider; transferred by Scott Schneider; source: 3xDPA 4006c w/30mm APE Spheres(Decca Tree[0.5m spacing from center]/LOC at front corner of FOH/10')->Sonosax->SD744t(24bit/96kHz) [3]. Also: Audio captured at 24-bit/96kHz via Sonosax into an SD744t recorder [3]",
